# Project Rules Entry

Before editing code, read `AGENTS.md`.

Then load only the matching rule files based on the files being changed:

- JS / TS files: `.cursor/rules/code-style/js-ts-code-style.md`, `.cursor/rules/code-style/jsdoc-rule.md`
- React files (`*.tsx` / `*.jsx`): `.cursor/rules/code-style/react-code-style.md`
- `src/views/**`: `.cursor/rules/code-style/react-view-structure.md`
- `src/components/**`: `.cursor/rules/code-style/components-structure.md`
- `src/domain/**`: `.cursor/rules/code-style/domain-agents.md`
- Adding / moving files, or unsure where code belongs: `.cursor/rules/code-style/project-structure.md`
- Extracting shared hooks / utils / components: `.cursor/rules/code-style/ui-logic-organization.md`

Do not apply Vue-specific naming rules unless the task involves Vue files or Vue Composition API.
